      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seems kinda related to my feature request of changing how locked portals work.\n\nSee: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/change-locked-portals-to-friend-portals\n\nBasically, simplify the \"locked portals\" to be allowed for any instance types. Simply rebrand it as \"friends only portals\". There should be nothing wrong with allowing players to create a portal to a public instance that only their friends can see. Just make the portals look slightly different so people can see that it is a portal that only they and the portal creator's friends can see.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
