  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-05-31T19:20:29.012Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When creating a new portal for a Group+ or Group Public, you are unable to select a locked or unlocked portal. \n\nGroup+ portal drops default to a locked portal that only friends and group members can see. Group Public portals default to an open portal everyone can see.\n\nSelecting the lock icon simply drops the portal.",
